WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:09.322
Geometry is a way to describe shapes and measure them.

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:19.218
Perimeter is like a fence around the outside: add the sides.

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:31.446
Area is like floor tiles inside: multiply for a rectangle, or take half of base times

00:00:31.446 --> 00:00:39.638
height for a triangle. For circles, circumference goes around and area covers the

00:00:39.638 --> 00:00:40.346
inside.

00:00:43.146 --> 00:00:48.378
Triangle angles always add to one hundred eighty degrees.

00:00:52.346 --> 00:00:57.314
Use cm for lengths and cm squared for areas.
